                        <border color="2" width="100" shift="50" />
                    </borders>
                </line_symbol>
            </symbol>
            <symbol type="16" id="64" code="301" name="Uncrossable body of water, with bank line">
                <description>The black bank line emphasises that the feature is uncrossable.

Dominant areas of water may be shown with 70% colour.
 
Small areas of water and bodies of water that have narrow parts shall always be shown with full colour.

Minimum width (inside): 0.3 mm.
Minimum area (inside): 0.55 mm x 0.55 mm (footprint 8 m x 8 m).</description>
