of water (301). 

The symbol may be combined with a rough open land symbol (403, 404) to show openness.

At least two blue lines shall be clearly visible.

The symbol is orientated to north.

Minimum width: 2 lines or 0.8 mm (inside).

Smaller areas must either be left out, exaggerated or shown using symbol
Uncrossable body of water (301).</description>
