                        </symbol>
                    </pattern>
                </area_symbol>
            </symbol>
            <symbol type="4" id="115" code="414" name="Vineyard or similar">
                <description>A vineyard or similar cultivated land containing dense rows of plants offering
good or normal runnability in the direction of planting. 
The lines shall be orientated to show the direction of planting. 

At least three lines shall be clearly visible. 

Must be combined with either symbol Open land (401) or Rough open land (403).

Minimum area: 2 mm x 2 mm (footprint 30 m x 30 m).

[Editors note: combine with 401 or 403]</description>
