            <symbol type="2" id="181" code="532" name="Stairway">
                <description>A distinct stairway through the terrain which helps to climb very steep slopes or to cross over impassable objects. 

A stairway going through rock passages or between impassable objects may be drawn without border lines.

An easily runnable stairway or indistinct stairway should be drawn as a footpath. 

Steps of a stairway shall be represented in a generalized manner.

Minimum length: 3 (graphical) steps.
Minimum width: 0.4 mm (IM).</description>
